  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "Program acts as the apex orchestrator for the JARVIS application, managing the entire system lifecycle from configuration loading to shutdown. It coordinates complex interactions by driving the main event loop and the internal 'Thought-Action' agent loop. Its primary responsibilities include initializing services like ModelOrchestrator, managing tool execution via ToolRegistry, and handling user input flow through the Agent Loop. It ensures persistence by interfacing with HistoryManager and manages state transitions via ProcessManager."
  },
